        "epoch": 1,
        "hypothesis": "Combining removal of Prim's temporary cycle matrix and repeated BFS checks with read-only references, byte membership flags, and a shared recursive path stack may reduce repeated allocation and copy costs. The integrated full-program runtime still needs controller measurement.",
        "id": "e4ac65068e104b68",
        "ordinal": 1,
        "parent_id": null,
        "role": "G",
