        "transformations": {
          "files": [
            "src/tropical.cpp"
          ],
          "retained": [
            "Removed Prim_ST's temporary cycle matrix, its updates, and repeated is_cycle traversal; candidate edges connect the selected tree to an unselected vertex, so the check is redundant.",
            "Changed read-only graph, edge, and helper-vector parameters to const references; changed Prim membership flags from vector<bool> to byte storage and retained lowest-index minimum ties with a min scan followed by a matching-index scan.",
            "Reused the recursive path vector as a push/pop stack, restoring it on failed branches instead of copying path history at each recursive call."
          ]
        },
