        "hypothesis": "Combining the selected parent’s Prim and reference/path-stack changes with CSR tree traversal and incremental compact-color counts may cut repeated edge-list scans and path color rescans. The baseline is already faster than each measured archived candidate, so this is a narrowly targeted full-program integration hypothesis, not an assumed speedup; the controller should compare the complete binary.",
        "id": "aa72717bfb1d4d60",
        "ordinal": 2,
        "parent_id": "e4ac65068e104b68",
